  "comment": "Sibling of OverflowThrowSettingHonored: identical inputs, Overflow=Promote.\nlong.MaxValue + long.MaxValue overflows the Long kind; under Promote the\nhandler widens Long→Decimal silently and returns the sum without error.\nTogether the pair pins that the Overflow axis distinguishes outcome.",
